Login to Azure Portal.
- Create new resource
- Search for 'Playwright workspace'
- Create
- Fill details Give new resource name if needed.
- review+Create
- Create
- Will take 5 mins
- go to resource
- Get started steps will show the next steps


for step 4:
az storage account show \
    --name "pwstrgresource011459" \
    --resource-group "Resource01" \
    --query id -o tsv

az role assignment create --assignee "617af757-2850-4649-96f4-0b436c5f44f5" --role "Storage Blob Data Contributor" --scope "$(az storage account show --name pwstrgresource011459 --resource-group Resource01 --query id -o tsv)"